Package: oofigure
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign Unicode box-drawing tables, callouts, and code borders in pure openOODA.
 Renders beautiful Unicode and ASCII box-drawing tables, callouts, and code borders.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 custom border styles, alert boxes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
